Output demo.gif
Set FontFamily "DejaVu Sans Mono"
Set FontSize 16
Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1600
Set Height 620
Set TypingSpeed 70ms

Hide
Type "exec env -u NO_COLOR CLICOLOR_FORCE=1 ./taskmd-ui -d demo/tasks"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Plan the launch/
Show
Sleep 2s
Type "j"
Sleep 1s
Type "/"
Type "priority:high"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "c"
Sleep 1s
Type "v"
Sleep 2s
Escape
Type "j"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 1s
